format: rzl.doc.v1
name: THUNDR-AUTOSIGN
version: 2.0.0
date: 2026-11-20
owner: Rizal · CHIEF (Decider) · ЯID-0001-3QQS
law: .rzl only, permanently. Never .zip and never .rzl.zip.
scope: all devices, sites, cryptogames, RVM, and apps through RTOR.
runs_from: any device inside the RENJIN RZL OPERATING SYSTEM — Neo,
  17e, Moto, or any hub seeder-leecher — via RTOR. Not Neo-only.
schedule: every 6 hours — 00:30, 06:30, 12:30, 18:30.
driver: thundr-autosign.sh v2 — reads targets, reads expiry (live profile
  first, recorded expiry second), re-signs DUE (<=48h) targets in place
  with rloader-resign.sh on the Neo, installs over with devicectl,
  verifies the new expiry is later. Never uninstalls, never wipes.
  Fails closed if the relay is down, the device is not visible, or
  rloader-resign.sh is not found. Check-only mode: --check-only.
first targets: RBOARDKeyboard info.rizal.dragonskull.rboardkeyboard
  expires 2026-11-21 15:44:27 MST; main/widget expire 2026-11-26 23:30 MST.
approval: authorized-by-owner-command, 2026-11-20 — NOT a cryptographic
  signature. No ghostkey accessed. No keys in this file.
